Z||000000||Earne||03-25-2000||08:26 PM||||I just stumbled across this site:<P> <A HREF="http://www.gm-restorationparts.com/ewopg/consumer/entry.asp" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gm-restorationparts.com/ewopg/consumer/entry.asp</A> <P><BR>I tried to find any available parts for the/our Fiero and it seems Pontiac is pretending they never existed.  The least they could do is say that no restor parts are available.  I sent this message to the GM webmaster:<P><BR>"The Fiero seems to be missing from the list of models in the Pontiac section.  If models like the Chieftan, the GTO and the Townsman can be supported, why not the only mid engine vehicle ever made in America.  Please explain.<P>Earne Moon<BR>Lincoln Park, MI<BR>Fiero Owner<BR>Michigan Fiero Club"<P>I'll let you know if I get a response.  I expect they will pretend I don't exist either.  Wanna bet?  Any takers?<p>[This message has been edited by Earne (edited 03-26-2000).]||||reg||13
