Z||000007||Earne||03-26-2000||07:46 AM||||GT B,<P>Which GM division do you work for?  Sounds a little defensive to me.  I don't believe it is entirely correct to say that we wouldn't have a Fiero if not for GM.  Sure, in a way it is, but the GM beaners and division honchos fought it all the way.  If it were not for the tanacity of Hulki Aldikacti, we would not have the Fiero.  Hulki is the Michaelangelo in the this sculpture, GM is closer to the hammer and chisel.  IMHO<P>Earne (ToyMaker)||||reg||1
