Z||000027||Earne||03-31-2000||07:56 AM||||Chadman,<P>Remember the part about 35 years?  I spent two years in Germany (with our Uncle) around 1970.  I was fortunate to buy the car from an officer that was leaving country.  I do have some pics in an album, I'll find them in a few days.  The thing I remember most is Germany has (had) an owner registration book.  It lists all the owners of the vehicle.  The first owner was I.W. Porche.  The car was very fancy.  Black leather bolsters on the seats with leopard skin inserts on the seat and back.  Don't know if it belonged to one of the "family" or not.  I had fun with it though.||||reg||1
